"{\"edits\":[{\"start\":0,\"end\":1,\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d check the earlier-arriving option first: it reports the same 275,000 Turkish Miles&Smiles points as the other shown choice, arrives in Bangkok 4 hours 35 minutes earlier, and has a total elapsed time 4 hours 31 minutes shorter. Its Istanbul wait is also 4 hours 40 minutes shorter, though its LAX wait is one minute longer. Both combine an SFO–LAX positioning flight with an award itinerary; whether those components are on separate tickets is unverified. Award seats, taxes and support for your one-traveler request are also unverified, so confirm those before relying on this choice.\"}]}]}"
